Title: F2-M01 — A Line in the Snow (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

COMMANDER SAVA
(serious)
The junction was abandoned in haste. Someone wanted us to believe the road was undefended.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

LIEUTENANT PETROV
(measured)
Tracks lead north, but the snow has hidden their numbers.

COMMANDER SAVA
(firm)
Establish a foothold and clear the junction. Expect a second group to emerge once we commit.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
